{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/10626-hell-is-arcadia","id":10626,"title":"Hell is Arcadia","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-14T11:47:11-08:00","id":10626,"title":"Hell is Arcadia","content":"With the inhuman forms, the pacts, the powers, and the freedom allowed in Arcadia but not on Earth I'm starting to wonder if True Fae are just Unchained who found the Hell they were looking for. Or, at least, something close enough to it....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1110-unjustcustos","name":"UnjustCustos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-14T11:56:08-08:00","id":10637,"title":"","content":"If you're looking for a physical Hell, I see it as hard to top taking over a fracture for yourself. You basically have a free playground to rule over.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-14T12:08:20-08:00","id":10656,"title":"","content":"That'd fit with my headcanon that Arcadia is the antithesis of the God-Machine; if the God-Machine can be considered Heaven, then Arcadia is indeed Hell.<br /> There's also that theory in the C:tL core book, I think, where one wonders if the True Fae aren't actually angels driven mad by an absence of God. Maybe they were instead Angels who wandered deep into the Hedge, aeons ago, or maybe they were ordered to go there, and once they reached their destination, they found they'd lost all contact with the God-Machine. Over time as the Thorns twisted them, they went mad, or tried to find ways to catch the God-Machine's attention. Nowadays, they manage sometimes to reach reality, but they're so twisted by the chaos of the Wyrd the God-Machine simply doesn't recognize them or wants anything to do with them. (Not sure how much I like <i>that</i> interpretation, though.).<br /> (If you involve Mages into that scenario, though, it becomes extra messy like whoa. But that's nothing new.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-14T18:18:03-08:00","id":10957,"title":"","content":"I notice a very interesting bit of text on page 37 that mentions that the God-Machine makes the SEASONS turn and such. <br /> <br /> Which makes you wonder what the Changelings in the Court have allied themselves with exactly. Dupes of the God Machine? Really free or just unknowingly serving a new master. Acting as a bulwark against the Chaos of Arcadia.<br /> <br /> My current thoughts are that Gentry are their own thing. My personal headcannon is that they are &quot;alien&quot; programs from a &quot;rival&quot; to the God Machine (which may be the Wyrd, or may be that's just a &quot;subroutine&quot; of a larger unknowable cosmic entity of Chaos). Infectious meme programs that infected Humanity (and therefore the God Machine) over 10,000 years ago. The GM partitioned them off in Arcadia and erected the Hedge as a sorta &quot;firewall&quot;. Meanwhile it altered this reality to be antithetical to them, but they managed to &quot;hack&quot; the system enough to be allowed to take people back to Arcadia to perpetuate the meme virus's existence via new carriers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>&quot;There is no God in the Badlands.&quot; </i></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Sunny</span></span><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img41/8167/obcp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/599-hawthorn","name":"Hawthorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar599_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-15T06:43:54-08:00","id":11228,"title":"","content":"... as much as I don't like inserting too much cold logic into everything Fae, I oddly like that idea a lot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-15T18:17:07-08:00","id":11751,"title":"","content":"Fae and Angel discussions on logic make me think of the Simpsons episode <i>Girls Just Want to Have Sums</i>, where the teacher asks Lisa; &quot;How do numbers make you feel?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/237-dagcon-faraday","name":"Dagcon Faraday","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T03:01:19-08:00","id":11979,"title":"","content":"This seems like a cool idea. Unchained having Achieved hell would be much different then they are now, whether that means they are their own God Machines or they become the Seeds of the Fae Species.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T01:41:48-08:00","id":12590,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hawthorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/10626-hell-is-arcadia?p=10957#post10957\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I notice a very interesting bit of text on page 37 that mentions that the God-Machine makes the SEASONS turn and such.<br /> <br /> Which makes you wonder what the Changelings in the Court have allied themselves with exactly. Dupes of the God Machine? Really free or just unknowingly serving a new master. Acting as a bulwark against the Chaos of Arcadia.</div> </div> </div> </div>If Embeds are using understanding of the workings of the universe/God-Machine in order to do things, would the changeling/Fae contracts simply be embeds/exploits by another name? To extend the programming metaphor of Demon, could the Changeling contracts be service requests? Help desk trouble tickets, asking for changes in the area around them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1173-sparowl","name":"Sparowl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T06:10:04-08:00","id":12684,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sparowl</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/10626-hell-is-arcadia?p=12590#post12590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If Embeds are using understanding of the workings of the universe/God-Machine in order to do things, would the changeling/Fae contracts simply be embeds/exploits by another name? To extend the programming metaphor of Demon, could the Changeling contracts be service requests? Help desk trouble tickets, asking for changes in the area around them?</div> </div> </div> </div>This is once again only my own headcannon, but I think Contracts work in a similar fashion to Embeds and Exploits, however there source is different. <br /> <br /> We are told that Embeds are &quot;rules&quot; or &quot;backdoors&quot; or &quot;exceptions&quot; that the God Machine set into reality eons ago when it was laying down things like how gravity works. It seems to have done these things to facilitate the utility of its agents. Allowing angels to do &quot;impossible&quot; things in our world while never actually breaking any of its laws or rules, reality accommodates the exception.<br /> <br /> I think contracts are also exceptions to the &quot;rules&quot; of reality or &quot;backdoors&quot; to the worlds processes. However, I think they are more like &quot;trojan&quot; programs placed in reality by the meme virus that is the Gentry when they first &quot;hacked&quot; into this world. While the God-Machine managed to partition the Gentry it was never able (or maybe simply never tried) to remove all the &quot;malware&quot; they placed into the worlds system before that happened. <br /> <br /> Changelings, being humans who's &quot;code&quot; has been infected by the compiling version of the meme-virus are able to access these &quot;trojan&quot; programs within the God Machines system and use them to create the various Contract effects we are familiar with. <br /> <br /> The exception being the Court Contracts (all Courts not just the seasonal ones) which are the result of the God Machine using Changelings against the Gentry for continued debugging, quarantine and simple distraction. Every moment a Gentry is engaging with Changelings (who are already infected anyway) is less time they spend infecting more humans with the meme virus. So Court Contracts are specially made &quot;service requests&quot; that the God Machine made available to Changelings.<br /> <br /> The Changeling folk tales about the Court founders interacting with the seasons recount these Changelings interactions with Angels. <br /> <br /> The only thing I don't have worked out yet for this headcannon is how Goblin Contracts and Hobs in general fit into this idea. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>&quot;There is no God in the Badlands.&quot; </i></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Sunny</span></span><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img41/8167/obcp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/599-hawthorn","name":"Hawthorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar599_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T07:34:36-08:00","id":12717,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/10626-hell-is-arcadia?p=11979#post11979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This seems like a cool idea. Unchained having Achieved hell would be much different then they are now, whether that means they are their own God Machines or they become the Seeds of the Fae Species.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not necessarily. It's a possibility, but it is also entirely feasible (and to me, preferable; I'm getting sick and tired of templates that change in fundamental ways when I perfectly enjoy how they already are) that the only difference is freedom.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T10:54:33-08:00","id":12808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aiden</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/10626-hell-is-arcadia?p=12717#post12717\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not necessarily. It's a possibility, but it is also entirely feasible (and to me, preferable; I'm getting sick and tired of templates that change in fundamental ways when I perfectly enjoy how they already are) that the only difference is freedom.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well at the very least then there would also be Fae who were never Demons and came about via Ascended Changelings. So if the only difference is Freedom what would that mean for those who didn't start out as Demons??","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T11:07:59-08:00","id":12814,"title":"","content":"I object to this very discussion. Demon and Changeling are two games, do not get your borscht into my peanut butter moon pies. They are mine. Arghlebargle rabblerabble!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/936-erichzahn","name":"ErichZahn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}